assert.deepEqual(assertEveryDifferenceRecorded({ differences, recorded: differences, comparisonExists: true }).unrecorded, []);
```

C002 boundary — zero differences still records the comparison, and a difference no rule can classify is recorded as unclassified rather than dropped. This is the acceptance criterion's edge case and F1's signature, asserted together because the second is what makes the first honest.
